# VENDORA Platform Supabase Credentials
# When configured, VENDORA seamlessly authenticates against your live Supabase project.
# When omitted, VENDORA safely runs in full-fidelity dev/review mode with all roles enabled.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here
